@page "/"

<PageTitle>louis-agent · the C# AI agent framework</PageTitle>
<PageHead Description="louis-agent is an AI agent framework in C#, on Microsoft.Extensions.AI, that runs on your own hardware. One engine, an identity and its packs, and a host to put it in front of people." />

@* The Overview (F164.1): its heading over the framework at a glance, the important parts highlighted, since (Louis)
   "do one like this highlight the important ones", then what it is with its real program, its whole map, what is
   built on it, and why C#. Each section ends with the docs it was written from. The five families are parts of the
   whole framework's section (F169.2), so each heads itself with an h3 under that section's h2. *@
<Band Id="top" Topic="The C# AI agent framework" Title="Build agents, not infrastructure." Summary="louis-agent runs the loop, guards every tool call, measures every request and puts your agent in front of people. You write who the agent is and what it can do.">
    <DiagramFigure Source="FrameworkAtAGlance.Source" />
</Band>

<Band Id="what-it-is" Topic="What it is" Title="A few lines of your own." Summary="Three ideas make an agent here. The engine runs its loop, an identity says who it is, and a pack says what it can do. Your program names the identities and packs it wants, then starts a host that puts the agent in front of people. This is the line that starts the coding agent, from its real program.">
    <CodeListing Name="Program.cs" Language="csharp" Code="@ProgramListings.RunTheCodingAgent" />
    <DocLinks>
        <DocLink Path="src/docs/adr/0027-engine-identities-and-packs.md">Engine, identities and packs</DocLink>
        <DocLink Path="src/docs/architecture/README.md">The architecture</DocLink>
    </DocLinks>
</Band>

<Band Id="the-whole" Topic="The whole framework" Title="Every project, in its family." Summary="The framework's projects sit in five families, a folder each. The engine runs the agent, and the hosts put it in front of people. The web is what every website is built on. The evals measure an agent, and the tools draw the docs' pictures and read what a model was really billed.">
    <DocLinks>
        <DocLink Path="src/docs/projects/README.md">Every project</DocLink>
    </DocLinks>
</Band>

